versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.8.dev4.official [b56a91878], v4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe]\n- Not Reproducible in: v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4 - macOS Tahoe (26.6.2) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (3456x2234 @ 120.00 Hz) - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads) - 64.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen `embed_subwindows` is disabled in project settings, changing `gui_embed_subwindows` at runtime has no effect.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Disable `display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows` from project settings\n2. Set `gui_embed_subwindows at runtime` via the following, before adding a new Window\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tget_tree().root.gui_embed_subwindows = true\n\n\tvar w := Window.new()\n\tw.size = Vector2(250, 250)\n\tadd_child(w)\n\tw.move_to_center()\n\n```\n3. Launch the project and notice that Windows does not embed correctly\n\n**4.8dev4**\n\n<img width=\"500\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d250e3d-1c8b-4ea0-ae15-749a3f9c8dc0\" />\n\n**4.7.2**\n\n<img width=\"500\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db683d4c-d139-459a-a19e-5aaf3b70cea1\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[no-respect-embed-subwindows.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31551465/no-respect-embed-subwindows.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions